    <briefdescription>
<para>Sub-stepper for linear-elastic/elastoplastic materials using an implicit return-mapping. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements the Pérez–Fouget (CPPM) sub-stepping strategy. The consistent algorithmic tangent is assembled incrementally via sub-step contributions.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>nSizeMatTangent</parametername>
